m,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">苹果发布新版Siri并引入谷歌Gemini模型，强调以用户为本的AI发展理念</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">OpenAI正式向SEC递交IPO申请草案，奥特曼重申普及AGI战略目标</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Moonshot AI开源编码代理Kimi Code升级：支持CLI一键安装与视频上下文</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">阿里巴巴整合组织架构成立 Token Foundry 事业部，由 CEO 吴泳铭直接挂帅</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/08bed301ae5444f1e85803f005b5985b.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">6月8日，阿里巴巴宣布重大战略升级，将通义大模型事业部与未来生活实验室合并，成立全新 Token Foundry 事业部，由集团 CEO 吴泳铭直接挂帅。此次调整将原通义大模型事业部核心力量与 Happy Horse、Happy Oyster 等业务线整合，旨在实现模型能力与应用场景的深度协同。同时，首席科学家周靖人将牵头成立 AI 未来研究院。阿里通过 Token Foundry 与此前成立的 Alibaba Token Hub 事业群协同，加速模型能力通过 MaaS 闭环反馈实现进化。商业化方面，阿里 AI 业务已进入回报周期，AI 相关产品收入连续十一个季度实现三位数增长，预计百炼 MaaS 平台等 AI 服务年化经常性收入（ARR）年底有望突破 300 亿元。技术层面，Qwen-3.7 模型在编程领域表</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">苹果联合谷歌与英伟达开发新一代AI模型Apple Foundation Model Cloud Pro</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/8b39bc8fda92ab60fca5393f84318fb7.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">苹果、谷歌与英伟达正式宣布达成深度合作，联合开发新一代人工智能模型Apple Foundation Model Cloud Pro。该模型在性能上对标谷歌Gemini等行业尖端产品，技术架构完全基于英伟达高性能GPU集群运行，并深度集成至苹果私有云计算（Private Cloud Compute）体系中。苹果人工智能业务负责人Amal Subramanian表示，此举旨在实现高性能计算与隐私保护的平衡。该合作不仅为Siri等原生应用向AI Agent演进提供算力支撑，更通过“最强算力+前沿模型+安全云原生”的组合，确立了端云协同与隐私安全双轨并行的全新范式。在算力成本激增的背景下，三大巨头的联手优化了底层资源配置，将加速全球人工智能终端及核心场景的深层变革，并重塑AI产业链竞争格局。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">苹果发布新版Siri并引入谷歌Gemini模型，强调以用户为本的AI发展理念</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/6966a0a6588676ea07ac46e8d14ff7b2.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">在2026年WWDC大会上，苹果正式发布全新版Siri，通过引入谷歌Gemini大模型及全新AI架构，显著提升了Siri在各类App中的协同能力。苹果软件工程高级副总裁克雷格在会上抨击了行业内“为AI而AI”的功利倾向，强调Apple Intelligence的核心应是解决用户痛点并提升日常效率。目前，开发者即日起可试用新版Siri，普通用户预计今年晚些时候迎来Beta测试版。受地区政策与监管要求影响，该功能初期暂不向欧盟地区提供，中国大陆地区的Siri AI及相关功能也需配合本地监管要求推进，暂未上线。此次更新标志着苹果在保持隐私与个性化前提下，正式通过接入外部大模型强化其智能生态，旨在通过更实用的AI技术赋能iOS与iPadOS用户。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">OpenAI正式向SEC递交IPO申请草案，奥特曼重申普及AGI战略目标</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/40228632a3893ece841b3cb4f05c2fbb.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">OpenAI已正式向美国证券交易委员会（SEC）提交IPO申请草案，标志着公司正式启动公开上市进程。此次决策是在公司完成重组为OpenAI Group公共利益公司（PBC）后做出的，旨在通过资本市场获取持续研发所需的巨额资金。数据显示，OpenAI今年1月年化收入已突破200亿美元，但2026年预计亏损缺口高达140亿至250亿美元。首席执行官Sam Altman发布愿景长文，重申“为每一个人提供个人AGI”的核心战略，并提出三大目标：打造自动化AI研究员、加速经济与科学发展、实现先进AI的广泛普及。随着OpenAI与Anthropic先后进入IPO流程，全球资本市场对AGI产业的估值逻辑将迎来重塑，两家头部企业上市后市值有望冲击万亿美元规模。此次IPO不仅是OpenAI应对高昂算力成本的必然选择，也标志着AI</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Moonshot AI开源编码代理Kimi Code升级：支持CLI一键安装与视频上下文</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/24f696f930bdafb44d8442d626660d6e.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Moonshot AI旗下开源编码代理Kimi Code近日完成重大版本升级，在易用性、多模态能力及生态兼容性方面实现显著突破。核心更新包括：支持一行CLI命令实现零配置快速安装；引入视频上下文处理能力，用户可拖入视频作为编码参考，支持LUT引用、长视频转短视频及屏幕录制转代码等场景。在生态扩展方面，Kimi Code已上线股票查询、财务报告及学术论文等插件，并全面支持ACP协议，兼容JetBrains、Zed等主流IDE。此次升级旨在降低开发门槛，通过多模态理解与插件化扩展，为开发者提供更高效的智能编码解决方案。目前，开源社区用户已可通过官方渠道获取最新版本，体验更广泛的开发环境适配与多模态开发便利。</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
